swift-wma
=========

This repository holds a Swift port of the Windows Media Audio decoders of
FFmpeg, https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg. The port follows the upstream files
listed below at FFmpeg commit c766e0de78b0239a36e49e50573e2297a7b500b4.
`README.md` maps each Swift file to the upstream files it ports.

Each upstream file is under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1
or (at your option) any later version. The port is a modified version of those
files, so the port is under the same license. `LICENSE` holds the full text of
version 2.1.

The port changes the language of the upstream files from C to Swift. The work
started in 2026, in the Musup repository of Toba.

